[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4044778288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117312#issuecomment-4044778288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117312","id":4044778288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xFmsw","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T08:07:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T08:07:02Z","body":"This comment https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110888#issuecomment-3335577447 in another 2d batching issue indicates that drawing the same Mesh with the same material is expected to be automatically batched. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4044778288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4047098737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117312#issuecomment-4047098737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117312","id":4047098737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xOdNx","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T14:13:39Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T14:13:39Z","body":"The comments said we wont process mesh as batch.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e295eba0eb4767fd45ea8534765307d8e9b1c328/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_canvas_gles3.cpp#L1175-L1179\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4047098737/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4047718358","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117312#issuecomment-4047718358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117312","id":4047718358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xQ0fW","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T15:31:47Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T16:24:42Z","body":"> The comments said we wont process mesh as batch.\n\nI see, good find. That at least explains where it's breaking the batching. But I wonder why they can't be batched then, and if this is still correct. It appears drawing 2d meshes can be batched using a MultiMesh. So I wonder why successive 2d mesh draw commands on CanvasItem can't be batched.\n\nEdit: Tested doing a simple MultiMesh with the mesh in the example above \n```\nmultimesh = MultiMesh.new()\nmultimesh.mesh = mesh\n\t\n# Set the format first.\nmultimesh.transform_format = MultiMesh.TRANSFORM_2D\n\n# Then resize (otherwise, changing the format is not allowed).\nmultimesh.instance_count = 10\n\n# Set the transform of the instances.\nfor i in multimesh.visible_instance_count:\n\tmultimesh.set_instance_transform_2d(i, Transform2D.IDENTITY.translated(Vector2(100+i*rect_size, 100+i*rect_size)))\n```\nAnd drawing these 10 instances of the same mesh `draw_multimesh(multimesh,null)` results in just one draw call as expected.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4047718358/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]